03:42:07.150 --> 03:42:16.700
he told silly jokes, he juggled balls, he even squirted water all over himself. But

03:42:16.700 --> 03:42:23.840
nobody in the crowd even smiled. "I don't want to be a clown anymore," said Loopy. "I

03:42:23.840 --> 03:42:30.000
want to be an acrobat instead." But Loopy had never tried being on a trapeze or the

03:42:30.000 --> 03:42:34.910
