03:43:12.550 --> 03:43:17.260
The crowd laughed until the tears ran down their faces.

03:43:17.820 --> 03:43:23.130
They clapped and cheered, and everyone said it was the funniest show they had ever seen.

03:43:23.590 --> 03:43:29.550
